{"id":"wb-8-265","name":"西方寺大殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:41+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西方寺大殿","text":"西方寺大殿，位于江苏省扬州市广陵区汶河街道驼岭巷18号扬州八怪纪念馆内，是中华人民共和国全国重点文物保护单位之一。\n\n1982年3月25日公布为第三批江苏省文物保护单位。2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。现佛寺改为扬州八怪纪念馆。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":92021578,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021578","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/18e8129bbd9bf3fe3b7e9b5b.jpg","title":"西方寺大殿1001.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A5%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF1001.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/%E8%A5%BF%E6%96%B9%E5%AF%BA%E5%A4%A7%E6%AE%BF1001.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Cangminzho","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​西方寺大殿","width":320,"height":213},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}